{"name": "Escape from Doomstown", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strategy-driven <strong>extraction survival game</strong>\u00a0where every trip into the city means weighing risks, making tough calls, and facing the zombie apocalypse head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/d57f8b1a554bec061ab440e4f4395f22.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The zombie outbreak is here. Stay alive. Get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supplies, weather, zombie hordes, and even other survivors. One bad call could spell the end of your squad. Build a base, recruit new teammates, and carve out a little corner of safety among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/ea4ab821e3de0ac789124ff13880ca81.poster.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/ea4ab821e3de0ac789124ff13880ca81.webm?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/ea4ab821e3de0ac789124ff13880ca81.mp4?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/b722b69b521bc59815ca417b07f907b6.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head into the quarantine zone and scavenge the city for anything that might keep you alive. Take on zombies and whatever else is waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The louder you get, the closer danger comes. Do you push your luck for one more haul, or play it safe and get out with what you've got?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/a4bd2c644667f1fe090684d673b033bf.poster.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/a4bd2c644667f1fe090684d673b033bf.webm?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/a4bd2c644667f1fe090684d673b033bf.mp4?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/8d5f6dc3bc5b2b13f93b15011db59273.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the dead rose, all kinds of people found themselves thrown together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit up to 20 unique survivors, each with their own story and abilities. Learn where they came from and guide the choices they make. Help them grow stronger\u2014or send them down an entirely different path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put their abilities to good use, build the right combinations, and fight your way through the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/9e950f6d157aff2afee1926a17f12a5f.poster.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/9e950f6d157aff2afee1926a17f12a5f.webm?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/9e950f6d157aff2afee1926a17f12a5f.mp4?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/dc9361663a68ce12f72a3765381d5960.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivor factions are all around you.\u00a0Make friends and form alliances to trade for resources and support, or hit them hard and take what you need. You can hoard everything you can just to survive.\u00a0Or...can you follow the clues and uncover the truth behind the zombie outbreak?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/521d9bc3a3515e2b79bfa0b563d14ff5.poster.avif?t=1787813005\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/521d9bc3a3515e2b79bfa0b563d14ff5.webm?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/extras/521d9bc3a3515e2b79bfa0b563d14ff5.mp4?t=1787813005\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A post-apocalyptic survival game where you lead a squad of survivors into a zombie-infested town. Scavenge for supplies, take down dangerous foes, and get out before the horde closes in. Build your base, recruit survivors, strengthen your squad, and fight your way out of this doomed city!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875750/5bca0b0830b69bcd87b3297b922610d9925a2910/header.jpg?t=1787813005", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Survival", "Simulation", "Indie", "Atmospheric", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Y.G.H.X.Studios", "publishers": "Y.G.H.X.Studios", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4875750", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BrIrjz7pO9Y", "first_seen": 1787781600.0, "review_rank": 40}